  <running_head />
  <bottom_margin>
    <catchword>Nomen</catchword>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">Tute virga mea &amp; pedum, jehova, es:</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">Tu deles animi nefas miselli.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">Ergo cur pudefiam, aut erubescam?</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">Ergo quid trepidus metu pavescam?</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Cur, si lethiferus eam per umbras,</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">Per vallem stygis ambulem, timscam</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Vllas, te duce me tuente larvas?</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Imò me bonitas tua undiquaque</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">Affectabitur: hoc quoad superstes</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">Fruar lumine: &amp; inde cum perennis</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">Tecum in secla domi tuae morabor.</l>
    <l n="12" type="heading" level="2" para="true">LEONARTVS VVEISSIVS: Visus suaviter olens.</l>
    <l n="13" para="true">
      <i>Flore suavius est nihil, sereno</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14" para="true">
      <i>Vere cum variat suos colores:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15" para="true">
      <i>Visum mulcet, et intimas medullas</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16" para="true">
      <i>Cordis exhilarat, dat utilemque</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17" para="true">
      <i>Aegris corporibus medelam. Aviti</i>
    </l>
    <l n="18" para="true">
      <i>Sic, VVEISSI inclyte, stemmatis tuorum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="19" para="true">
      <i>Flos es pulcher, odorus efficaxque,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="20" para="true">
      <i>Vel visu exhilarans tuos parentes:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="21" para="true">
      <i>Puta, moribus, eruditione,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="22" para="true">
      <i>Perpulchra experientia, artibusque</i>
    </l>
    <l n="23" para="true">
      <i>Tibi quas procul a domo profecto,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="24" para="true">
      <i>Gallus, Teuto, Iber, Italus, Britannus,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="25" para="true">
      <i>Et Belgae peperere, cateriq;</i>
    </l>
    <l n="26" para="true">
      <i>Quorum tu loca, facta et institută</i>
    </l>
    <l n="27" para="true">
      <i>Longo curriculo recens videbas.</i>
    </l>
    <l n="28" para="true">
      <i>Cresce, o sideribus bene auspicatis,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="29" para="true">
      <i>Selectissime flos odorque cresce:</i>
    </l>
    <l n="30" type="foot" para="true">Patritius Augustanus, &amp;c.</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>
    Marginal note at left, beside the poem's opening lines: "Patritius Augustanus, &amp;c." Lower right corner word "Nomen" is a catchword-like word, placed in the margin. Several words in the italic poem are uncertain due to print quality (e.g. "Aviti", "institută", "cateriq;"). The heading line "LEONARTVS VVEISSIVS:" is set in small capitals.
